<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to March 10 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     331	   25,960	7,672</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 27		643	  211</p>
<p>    Breeding females		1	    1,434	  237</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		410     28,076</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  7		140	   20</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    157	    1,460	  287</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  1		 46	    9</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    264	    5,932	  882</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
